# Compiled twins that a bare `tsc` used to emit beside every source file. The
# root tsconfig now sets `noEmit`, so they should never reappear — this is the
# guard against one being committed by accident (13 stale `*.test.js` twins had
# accumulated and were being collected as duplicate test suites).
# `scripts/*.mjs` are hand-written and deliberately NOT matched.
src/**/*.js
scripts/**/*.js
src-tauri/target/
src-tauri/gen/
src-tauri/binaries/
src-tauri/icons/
dev.out
dev.err

# Scratch artifacts from throwaway harnesses and test runs. These are
# regenerable, carry no information, and are easy to create by accident: a
# verification run that points DATA_DIR at a relative path silently builds its
# whole database inside the repo root instead of a temp directory, one
# `tmp-cri-<pid>/` per run. 11 of them had accumulated here untracked, each
# containing a stray `chat/` tree.
tmp-cri-*/
data-verify-tmp*/
web/test-results/
playwright-report/

# Local agent tooling state, not project source. `.superpowers/` holds per-task
# progress notes for work still in flight; `prompt.txt` is a scratch task brief.
# Neither belongs in history, and both are worth keeping on disk.
.superpowers/
prompt.txt
